/*
 * Implements validation for `continue` expressions in Ymir.
 *
 * A `continue` expression skips the remainder of the current loop iteration and
 * resumes execution at the loop’s next iteration point.
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 *   - ensure that `continue` appears inside a loop
 *   - ensure that no scope guard is active when continuing
 *   - construct a ContinueValue
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::instruction::continue_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/instruction/continue_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-02
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
